        "parameters": {
          "content": "# Section 2 - Failure Test\n\nOwned By: Sohila Khaled\nLast Updated: 24.07.2026\n\nWebhook workflow that intentionally fails to test error workflow\ntriggering. Called by the main Debugging Practice workflow.\n\n## Endpoint\n- GET /webhook/course/n8n103/failure-test\n- Authentication: Header Auth (n8n Academy API Key)\n\n## Flow\n1. TriggerWebhook: Receives request and responds immediately\n2. CallFailingEndpoint: Calls guaranteed-failure endpoint and throws\n3. Execution ends in an unhandled error\n4. Linked Error Workflow (Section 2 - Error Handler) runs\n\n## Error Configuration\n- CallFailingEndpoint left on default On Error (Stop Workflow)\n- Error Workflow linked to Section 2 - Error Handler\n\n## Requirements\n- Must be published for production execution\n- Must have Error Workflow configured in settings\n\nPart of: n8n Foundations Program, N8N103 Course, Section 2\n",
